---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy | Arash Ershadi"
  description="Privacy policy and data handling statement for the architectural monograph portfolio."
  lang="en"
  currentPath="/privacy/"
>
  <div class="site-container page-header">
    <span class="text-label">Legal // Transparency</span>
    <h1 class="page-title text-serif">Privacy Policy</h1>
  </div>

  <div class="site-container-narrow page-body">
    <section class="privacy-section">
      <h2 class="text-xl">1. Information Collection & Zero-Tracking Default</h2>
      <p>
        This portfolio website is designed as a static architectural monograph. We do not intentionally harvest, track, profile, or sell personal data.
      </p>
      <p>
        No third-party tracking scripts, advertising pixels, or telemetry beacons are enabled by default.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="privacy-section">
      <h2 class="text-xl">2. Direct Voluntary Communications</h2>
      <p>
        If you contact us via email or submit a project inquiry through the contact form, your provided name, email, and project details are used exclusively for direct correspondence regarding architectural commissions or research collaboration.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="privacy-section">
      <h2 class="text-xl">3. Optional Analytics Integration</h2>
      <p>
        If Google Analytics is explicitly enabled by the site operator (via <code>PUBLIC_GA_MEASUREMENT_ID</code>), anonymized traffic data is gathered solely to understand aggregate readership. You can opt out of analytics tracking at any time using standard browser privacy extensions or enabling "Do Not Track" / Global Privacy Control.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="privacy-section">
      <h2 class="text-xl">4. Contact & Inquiries</h2>
      <p>
        For inquiries regarding data protection, please contact: <a href="mailto:arash.ershadi.arch@example.com" class="text-accent">arash.ershadi.arch@example.com</a>.
      </p>
    </section>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .page-header {
    padding-top: var(--space-16);
    padding-bottom: var(--space-8);
  }

  .page-title {
    margin-top: var(--space-2);
  }

  .page-body {
    padding-bottom: var(--space-24);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-8);
  }

  .privacy-section h2 {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-3);
  }

  .privacy-section p {
    font-size: var(--text-base);
    line-height: var(--leading-relaxed);
    color: var(--color-text-body);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-3);
  }
</style>
